Deep with current successor | Archived entry; active Letta Code followed |\n| https://tokenade.net/en | Memory/context | Deep from public product evidence | Commercial token optimizer |\n| https://github.com/mksglu/context-mode | Memory/context | Deep | Session continuity and routing |\n| https://github.com/zilliztech/claude-context | Code/graph | Deep | Semantic code search |\n| https://github.com/drona23/claude-token-efficient | Memory/context boundary | Deep focused | Prompt policy, not runtime |\n| https://github.com/James-Chahwan/repo-graph | Code/graph | Deep | Cross-stack structural flow graph |\n| https://github.com/asharirfan/repo-lens/ | Code/graph | Deep | Local architecture report |\n| https://reposlens.com | Code/graph; audit | Deep | Hosted architecture governance |\n| https://www.npmjs.com/package/dependency-cruiser | Code/graph; audit | Deep | JS/TS dependency rules |\n| https://github.com/juspay/code-review-graph-rescript | Code/graph; audit | Deep | Typed graph and PR review |\n| https://github.com/topoteretes/cognee | Memory; graph adjacent | Deep | Graph/ontology memory |\n| https://tree-sitter.github.io/tree-sitter/ | Code/graph foundation | Deep | Incremental parser framework |\n| https://github.com/Consiliency/treesitter-chunker | Code/graph foundation | Deep | Syntax-aware chunker |\n| https://github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep | Code/graph foundation; audit | Deep | Structural AST search/lint/rewrite |\n| https://github.com/Orthic-Labs/Membrane | Memory/context | Deep | Governed context admission |\n| https://github.com/Orthic-Labs/cortex | Code/graph | Deep with status caveat | Repository source-truth graph |\n| https://github.com/k1lgor/RepoDoctor | Audit | Deep | Repository health/remediation |\n| https://github.com/oxc-project/oxc | Code foundation; audit | Deep | JS/TS toolchain |\n| https://github.com/millionco/react-doctor | Audit | Deep | React-focused audit |\n| https://github.com/opengrep/opengrep | Audit | Deep | Open deterministic SAST